Die Hard: Nakatomi Plaza - All In One Modding Tools.
Actual Version is V1.0.

//  Upcoming fixes and improvements for V1.1.

[Software Improvements:]

+   You can now build your own .rez archive (including the Engine.REZ that has different header type!).
+   You can now remove, replace, add file(s) to you existing .REZ archive and save the modified archive!
+   Syntax-checker, highlighter and suggestionBox for Nakatomi script editor!
+   Audio player for the audio filetypes!

[Fixes:]

*  Fix .LTA and .LTB-related issues // In progress.

[Additions:]

+   REZ archive builder!
+   REZ archive manipulator!
+   Script editor with syntax checker and suggestionBox.
+   Audio player

//  External console with .dll injection:
*  The game features with a built-in console designed for only display debug messages, so you can not input anyting. My aim is to create an external console for input cvars.

